      "versionNonce": 1060,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "条目标识: (index, term)\n一致性检查: prevLogIndex+prevLogTerm 强前缀匹配\n冲突处理: leader 按 Match/Next 回退，覆盖冲突尾部\nLeader 侧状态: progress tracker 精确跟踪每个 follower",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 65,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "条目标识: (index, term)\n一致性检查: prevLogIndex+prevLogTerm 强前缀匹配\n冲突处理: leader 按 Match/Next 回退，覆盖冲突尾部\nLeader 侧状态: progress tracker 精确跟踪每个 follower",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-p2-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1870,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
